Root cause:
The bug was caused by incorrect escape sequences in the `fprintf` function calls for coloring text output, which led to NCURSES errors. Additionally, the handling of the `t->duplicate` check was removed, which may have contributed to inconsistencies in output formatting and potential errors when displaying packet information.

