Reason:
The incorrect escape sequence in the `fprintf` function call for coloring text output (`%sc[0m` instead of `%s%c[0m`) caused NCURSES errors. Additionally, the removal of the handling for `t->duplicate` led to inconsistencies in output formatting, which could also contribute to errors when displaying packet information.

The code statements that fix the bug are:
