The patch corrects the escape sequence in the `fprintf` function call to properly format the output for NCURSES (`%s%c[0m`), ensuring that the text is colored correctly without causing errors. It also reinstates the handling of `t->duplicate`, which ensures that duplicate packet information is displayed correctly, maintaining consistency in the output formatting.


